  "agent": "eXp Realty- Main Office",
  "text": "NEW ADJUSTED PRICE! Perched above the south shores of Lake Washington in the coveted Lakeridge community, this timeless mid-century home showcases breathtaking lake and Cascade Mountain views while offering the perfect blend of classic character and thoughtful updates. The spacious living room features a cozy fireplace and six built-in surround sound speakers, creating an inviting space for relaxing or entertaining. The functional floor plan includes a private primary suite with a 3/4 bath, and all appliances stay, making this home move-in ready. The dining room opens through a large sliding glass door to an expansive wraparound deck, where you'll overlook stunning Lake Washington views and exceptional indoor-outdoor living. Crown molding throughout and custom built-in wall shelving add warmth and architectural charm. Major updates include a 50-year roof installed in 2019 and LeafGuard gutters for added peace of mind. Downstairs offers a one-car attached garage, washer and dryer, and a convenient laundry sink. Outside, the flat backyard provides space to garden, play, or unwind, with an existing French drain already in place. Conveniently located with easy access to Seattle, Renton, parks, and major commuting routes, this is a rare opportunity to own a well-maintained home with incredible views, timeless design, and endless potential.",
