  "text": "Opportunity awaits in this 1,770 sq. ft. Shoreline home, offered as-is and ready for its next chapter! Owned by the same family for nearly 40 years, this property offers a wonderful opportunity for buyers looking to update, personalize, and build equity. Major improvements include a newer roof, furnace, and hot water heater. The interior retains much of its original character, with vintage finishes and appliances that reflect a bygone era, complemented by a newer refrigerator. Bring your imagination and make this home your own! Conveniently located in the desirable Shoreline School District, within walking distance of Aurora Village shopping, dining, and transit, with easy access to I-5 and major commuter routes. Whether you're an investor, renovator, or buyer looking to create your dream home, this property offers outstanding potential in an established Shoreline neighborhood. Sold as-is; seller will make no repairs.",
