  "agent": "Windermere RE Greenwood",
  "text": "Enjoy panoramic views of Puget Sound & Olympics from this beautiful North Beach home ideally located on a quiet dead-end street in one of Seattle's most treasured neighborhoods. A timeless home with a whisper of Cape Cod, you'll love the rich mahogany, coved ceilings, white oak hardwoods, large windows, and gorgeous views at every turn. Prepare meals and entertain in a spacious granite kitchen which opens to adjoining sitting room, formal dining, and doors to incredible back patio and deck. Relax beside a romantic wood-burning fireplace in living room and watch the boats parade by in Puget Sound. Upstairs are 4 beds, all with views, including a primary suite with marble bath, walk-in closet, and private deck. Downstairs, discover a cozy rec room perfect for movie nights, a guest suite, flex space for hobbies, and potential for future MIL apt or AADU if desired. With multiple home office and WFH options, the versatile layout offers flexibility for today's lifestyle. Step outside and enjoy the saltwater air, dream patios and decks, outdoor gas fireplace, private yard, mature landscaping, oversized garage with shop space, and abundant off-street parking. Located within the geographic boundary to join North Beach Club for private beach access! Just minutes from the vibrant shops, restaurants, and amenities in Ballard yet wonderfully removed from the hustle and bustle. Welcome home!",
