  "agent": "Keller Williams Eastside",
  "text": "HUGE Price Drop for quick sale!! Welcome to this beautifully updated Maple Leaf home where major improvements (over $55K) thoughtful design & an exceptional location come together! The stylish kitchen shines with quartz counters, Cafe 5-burner induction cooktop, Bosch dishwasher, dual convection ovens, artisan tile backsplash, coffee bar/wine storage, generous pantry & charming checkerboard floors. Access the deck with cedar railings, overlooking the private fenced backyard. Enjoy year-round comfort with a BRAND-NEW roof, NEW high-efficiency furnace with A/C, tankless water heater, updated plumbing & 6 new Milgard fiberglass windows. Fresh interior paint, updated LED lighting, custom blinds & beautifully refreshed baths with quartz vanities & LED mirrors add to the move-in-ready appeal. Downstairs daylight basement has open layout, utility room and 4th bedroom plus separate entrance that flows out to the backyard. Wired for a hot tub or sauna. New concrete driveway accommodates up to 4 cars, plus alley access, and new retaining wall. Just minutes to Green Lake & Maple Leaf Reservoir Park, with restaurants, coffee, breweries, PCC & Whole Foods nearby. Take the Roosevelt light rail to Downtown, sporting events, University of Washington, Childrens Hospital, & Sea-Tac Airport. Parks, pickleball, neighborhood events, dining & recreation are all close by. I-5 access just down the street. An ideal combination of city convenience and neighborhood living!",
