  "agent": "Specialty Real Estate Group",
  "text": "IMPORTANT: This block of 35th Ave NE is a quiet street and NOT an arterial. Don't settle for a detached condo when you can own a true single family home on its own lot. Stylishly refreshed and move-in-ready 3 bedroom mid-century modern rambler located in Seattle's Cedar Park neighborhood. Brand new kitchen with flat-panel oak grain cabinets, quartz countertops, custom tile work and stainless steel appliances. Brand new designer bathroom. Brand new hard surface flooring throughout. Fresh paint. Updated building envelope with new siding. Spacious driveway with room for RV parking and carport with standalone storage room. Ginormous front and back yards perfect for entertaining guests. Situated near the north side of the lake, makes commuting a breeze. Easy access to Lake Washington, freeways, Northgate and Downtown Seattle. Buyer to verify potential to build ADU/DADU(s) in the backyard. Ask us about financing incentives with preferred lender Specialty Home Loans.",
